/-!
# Group 4, row two: the matrix power and the fresh/seed moment bounds (kernel certificate)

`rhoTwo` is the rounded-up profile `ρ_r ≥ (F_next^{32-r} (F + 10^{-30})^{32(r-1)})^{1/31}`
at scale `10^24` (so `μ_r ≤ ρ_r`); `cFreshTwo` bounds `∑_r (𝐐^h)_{32,r} ρ_r`, and `cSeedTwo` bounds
`∑_r (𝐐^h)_{32,r} (X/S)^r` with `X = 0`.
-/

@[expose] public section

open GMCNumerics

namespace GMCExplicitDelta.Certificates.Group4

